<title>UK: JP Morgan unit sets A$100 million three-year bond.</title>
<headline>JP Morgan unit sets A$100 million three-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Toronto Domionion.</p>
<p> BORROWER   JP MORGAN AUSTRALIA (RATED AA1/AAA BY MOODYS/S&amp;P)</p>
<p> GUARANTOR  MORGAN GUARANTY CO</p>
<p> AMT    A$100 MLN     COUPON     6.75	MATURITY    24.FEB.00</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.395   PAY DATE    24.FEB.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.375     LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  =	   DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  SALE LIMITS US/UK/AU</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    N.Y	 TAX PROVS  STD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.375     SELL CONC  1.0	 PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p> NOTES	SENIOR, UNSECURED UNSUBORDINATED</p>
<p>		LAUNCHED OFF AN OFFERING CIRCULAR</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
